WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.240
Years ago, in the 1920s and the 1930s, they said,

00:04.240 --> 00:07.140
global cooling will kill the world.

00:07.140 --> 00:08.920
We have to do something.

00:08.920 --> 00:12.420
Then they said, global warming will kill the world.

00:12.420 --> 00:14.020
But then it started getting cooler.

00:14.020 --> 00:16.020
So now they could just call it climate change,

00:16.020 --> 00:18.340
because that way they can't miss.

00:18.340 --> 00:19.940
It's climate change.

00:19.940 --> 00:22.780
Because if it goes higher or lower, whatever the hell

00:22.780 --> 00:24.240
happens, there's climate change.

